Hi Eric, Patrick, Christian, Christopher, Jeremy, Lucas,
I wanted to take a moment to thank all of you for the support, guidance, an=
d encouragement you have given me during my time at Kforce.
Working with the Kforce US team has been one of the most valuable experienc=
es of my career. I joined with a lot to learn, and each of you helped me gr=
ow not only professionally but also personally. The knowledge, patience, tr=
ust, and support you showed me will always stay with me.
As some of you already know, I recently made the difficult decision to resi=
gn due to family circumstances. My family is planning to relocate so that w=
e can be together and support my parents with their ongoing medical needs. =
This was not an easy decision, and honestly, it happened much sooner than I=
 had expected.
The good news is that things are looking much better on the family side now=
, and I am hopeful that everything will settle down soon.
I would also like to personally thank a few people who have had a huge impa=
ct on my journey.
@Fryer, Patrick<mailto:pfryer2@kforce.com>, thank you for always being ther=
e whenever I needed help. Your guidance, support, patience, and willingness=
 to help in every situation made a huge difference to me. I have learned a =
lot from you, and I am truly grateful for everything you have done for me.
@Gondi, Christopher<mailto:cgondi@kforce.com>, thank you for all your suppo=
rt with Intune and technical topics. I learned a lot from your knowledge an=
d experience, and your guidance helped me build confidence in many areas.
@Estrada, Christian<mailto:CEstrada@kforce.com>, thank you for all your sup=
port with Microsoft 365 related tasks and day-to-day assistance. Your help =
and collaboration were always appreciated.
@Dunlap, Eric<mailto:edunlap@kforce.com>, a very special thank you for your=
 overall support, trust, and encouragement throughout my journey. Your supp=
ort meant a lot to me and made my experience here much more positive.
@Cerveny, Jeremy<mailto:JCerveny@kforce.com>@Lucas, Weston<mailto:WLucas@kf=
orce.com> I also want to thank everyone else on the team who took the time =
to help, teach, guide, and support me whenever needed. The trust you placed=
 in me means a lot, and I sincerely appreciate it.
If there is one thing I would like all of you to know, it is that I am leav=
ing with nothing but gratitude and respect for this team.
If I ever get an opportunity to work with all of you again in the future, I=
 would gladly welcome it. It would genuinely make me happy to be part of su=
ch a great team once more.
Please stay in touch. If I can ever help with anything in the future, wheth=
er professionally or personally, feel free to reach out. I will always be h=
appy to help in any way I can.
Thank you once again for everything, for the support, the trust, the learni=
ng opportunities, and the memories.
I wish you all continued success, good health, and the very best for the fu=
ture.

Thanks and Regards,
Dnyaneshwar Karande

